 The stone bench in front of the library is being renovated. The renovation will take a few days. Please avoid using the bench during this time. We apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your cooperation.
A library note about a display: We have a new exhibit in the display case on the main floor. It's a collection of local historical artifacts loaned to us by the town museum. Stop by to check it out and learn more about the history of our community.
A message from the IT department: Reminder that our network is currently experiencing some issues with the Wi-Fi connection. Our team is working to resolve the problem as quickly as possible. In the meantime, please use the Ethernet ports to access the internet. Thank you for your patience and understanding.
A notice about a meeting: There will be a staff meeting on Wednesday at 2:00 PM in the conference room. Please make sure to attend and come prepared to discuss the upcoming community event. If you have any topics you'd like to raise, please let us know in advance.
A reminder from the administrative office: Don't forget to submit your expense reports by the end of the week. You can find the forms on our shared drive or ask if you need assistance. Thank you for your cooperation in keeping our records up to date. ... Show more
A message from the manager: Thank you to everyone who made our recent customer appreciation event a success. It was great to see so many happy faces and appreciate your hard work in making it happen. If you have any feedback or suggestions for future events, please don't hesitate to share them with us. Keep up the excellent work!
A park note about trail maintenance: As we continue our efforts to maintain our trails, please be aware that some sections may be closed temporarily for repairs. We appreciate your understanding and cooperation in helping us keep our trails safe and enjoyable for everyone.
A reminder from HR: Don't forget to complete your annual performance review. It's due on the 15th of this month. If you need guidance on how to fill it out or have questions, please reach out to your supervisor or HR representative. Your feedback is important and helps us to continue growing and improving as a team. ... Show more
A library note about an event: Join us this weekend for our annual book fair! We'll have special author signings, book giveaways, and exclusive discounts. Don't miss out on this exciting opportunity to discover new titles and connect with fellow book lovers. Mark your calendars for Saturday and Sunday, and we'll see you there! ... Show more
A notice about a training session: There will be a mandatory training session on Monday at 9:00 AM for all staff members. The session will cover important updates on our new software and best practices for customer service. Please make sure to attend and come prepared to participate. If you have any questions or concerns, please reach out to your supervisor or HR representative. ... Show more
A park note about a picnic area: Reminder that our picnic area in the park is available for use on a first-come, first-served basis. Please be respectful of other park visitors and keep your trash clean. We appreciate your cooperation in helping us maintain our facilities.
A message from the IT department: Reminder that our new software update is mandatory for all staff members. Please make sure to log in to your account and complete the update by the end of the week. If you have any issues or concerns, please contact our support team for assistance.
A reminder from the administrative office: Don't forget to submit your timesheets by the end of the week. You can find the forms on our shared drive or ask if you need assistance. Thank you for your cooperation in keeping our records up to date.
A reminder from HR: The deadline to apply for the annual employee recognition awards is approaching. Please submit your applications by the end of the week. If you have any questions or need assistance, please reach out to your supervisor or HR representative.
A park note about a festival: We're excited to announce that we're hosting a music festival in the park this weekend! Enjoy live music, delicious food, and a fun atmosphere with your fellow community members. Mark your calendars for Saturday from 12:00 PM to 6:00 PM. See you there! ... Show more
